WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.333
[Electronic-rock music builds.]
THE CITY NEVER SLEEPS.

00:00:03.333 --> 00:00:06.667
[Rain, street traffic and passing cars.]

00:00:06.667 --> 00:00:10.000
CHAOS — THE WILDCARD.
ONE JOB. EVERY DEBT COMES DUE.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
STEAL THE KEY. BREAK THE HOUSE.
Hunter and Chaos plan the archive heist.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.333
[Engine revs. Police sirens.]
LOSE THE HEAT.

00:00:23.333 --> 00:00:28.333
THE HOUSE OWNS EVERY ROAD.
SO TAKE THE ROOFTOPS.

00:00:28.333 --> 00:00:31.667
[Gunfire and sparks.]

00:00:31.667 --> 00:00:35.000
[A speedboat cuts through the canal.]

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.333
[Helicopter rotors. Searchlights over the city.]

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:41.667
GOLD MAGE — THE HOUSE.
EVERY DEBT COMES DUE.

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:45.000
[Motorcycle engine rises. Police pursuit.]

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
[Chaos runs. An explosion behind him.]

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
MAKE YOUR OWN EXIT.
THE HOUSE DOESN’T OWN YOU.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
CROWN CITY — NEON DEBT.
